From: EvilPatrick06 <187923600+EvilPatrick06@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:50:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(desktop): main.ts stops growing; the cron union's
 request handling lives in cron-job-union.ts

main.ts is over the 2000-line target and may only shrink. The all-gateways
job list's request handling (front answer, pooled sources beside the
connection, the front's install_id, the merge) moves into cron-job-union.ts
as answerWithEveryGatewaysCronJobs, with tests, and main.ts only wires it.
To offset the wiring, reusedPrimarySshDescriptor moves unchanged into
registry-session-sources.ts (main.ts passes it the primary's pending
descriptor), and the three reads of the pooled sources beside a connection
share pooledRegistrySourcesBeside. Behaviour is unchanged.
